g this incident. Pike had been sentenced to death for the 1995 murder of her classmate, Colleen Slemmer.]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/us-death-row-inmate-christa-pike-returns-to-prison-after-after-surviving-failed-lethal-injection-execution/articleshow/134859501.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/us-death-row-inmate-christa-pike-returns-to-prison-after-after-surviving-failed-lethal-injection-execution/articleshow/134859501.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-10-10T23:42:58+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">Trisha Mahajan</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-134859553,imgsize-46390.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[Amid claims that Kimberly Guilfoyle charged money to give access to Trump, leaked texts reveal her breakup with Donald Trump Jr was nasty]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/134859206.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/amid-claims-that-kimberly-guilfoyle-charged-money-to-give-access-to-trump-leaked-texts-reveal-her-breakup-with-donald-trump-jr-was-nasty/articleshow/134859206.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/amid-claims-that-kimberly-guilfoyle-charged-money-to-give-access-to-trump-leaked-texts-reveal-her-breakup-with-donald-trump-jr-was-nasty/articleshow/134859206.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-10-10T23:33:09+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">Poulomi Ghosh</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-134859291,imgsize-83384.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[Jackie Chan’s dollar-by-dollar school campaign raises over $192,000 for rural Chinese children]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/134855392.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[Jackie Chan transformed the act of giving into a global movement, urging fans to pitch in small donations for constructing schools in rural China. After six years, the initiative garnered over $96,000, which Chan generously matched, resulting in a remarkable total of over $192,000. This remarkable effort not only facilitated multiple school buildings but also underscored the power of collective action in uplifting communities through education.]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/rest-of-world/in-2006-jackie-chan-asked-fans-to-help-build-schools-one-dollar-at-a-time-and-promised-to-match-their-gifts-six-years-later-their-combined-contributions-had-passed-192000-for-children-in-rural-china/articleshow/134855392.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/rest-of-world/in-2006-jackie-chan-asked-fans-to-help-build-schools-one-dollar-at-a-time-and-promised-to-match-their-gifts-six-years-later-their-combined-contributions-had-passed-192000-for-children-in-rural-china/articleshow/134855392.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-10-11T03:53:00+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">TOI World Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-134855406,imgsize-191897.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[Taylor Swift’s $4M Nashville education centre showcases art by schoolchildren and artists with disabilities]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/134855419.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[In 2012, Taylor Swift donated $4 million to create an education center at the Country Music Hall of Fame and Museum. This center focuses on engaging children and families with the history of country music. Currently, it hosts an exhibition called Connection featuring works by students and artists from Friends Life Community. Participants learn letterpress printing techniques and create their own unique posters.]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/in-2012-taylor-swift-pledged-4-million-for-a-nashville-education-centre-14-years-later-the-space-is-showcasing-artwork-by-local-schoolchildren-and-artists-with-developmental-disabilities/articleshow/134855419.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/in-2012-taylor-swift-pledged-4-million-for-a-nashville-education-centre-14-years-later-the-space-is-showcasing-artwork-by-local-schoolchildren-and-artists-with-developmental-disabilities/articleshow/134855419.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-10-11T02:55:00+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">TOI World Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-134855434,imgsize-53512.cms"/></item></channel></rss>